  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/box100-800.html",
  "prefLabel": "Box 101.04 Fighting sports",
  "priorExpiration": "1994-05-24",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Box 101.04 “Fighting sports” means “fighting sports” as defined in RSA 285:1, III, namely “professional boxing, and amateur and professional wrestling, mixed martial arts, kickboxing, or any other form of amateur or professional sport combat in which blows are struck that reasonably may be expected to inflict injury.”\n\nSource. #4420, eff 5-24-88; EXPIRED 5-24-94\n\nNew. #6256, eff 5-25-96; ss by #10482, eff 12-5-13; ss by #14498, eff 3-1-26",
